    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark fantasy classic RPG. Customize your race, gender and class. Gather a party with your favorite companions. Change the fate of the characters and the world with your choices. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create a character.</strong> Customize your race, sex, name, class and non-combat skill. Create a unique protagonist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who do you want to venture with?</strong> A human cleric, a dark elf ranger, or an orc defender? Gather a party that's the best for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices affect the plot.</strong> How you interact with people in neighboring country depends on you, but beware - you may start a war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-based combat with a focus on teamwork.</strong> Beware classes have their own strengths and weaknesses. Complement each other to win. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Characters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/f396a7976f32ef29c859019dc6d5d71a.avif?t=1732503360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Lord</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dark-one monarch who has lived for five hundred years. She is determined to end the perennial struggle between dark ones and humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/66b30e2486ab4181d6ac20ea35b6d419.avif?t=1732503360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hero</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A descendant of the legendary hero. It is a calling for him to expel dark ones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/0007850ca3af4fac7baf887e7d030ae2.avif?t=1732503360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Philia the Human Cleric</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cleric of the border sanctuary. She has a dream that one day everyone in the world can be equal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/422a238f743fdde2a1140a5f6abe7019.avif?t=1732503360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Venom the Dark Elf Ranger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark elf who specializes in swordplay and archery. His close friend was killed by the Hero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/6c2ff1e48c541406b56798d7c6749916.avif?t=1732503360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Coyote the Orc Defender</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boy warrior from a tribe. He longed for the acceptance of humans and dark elves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/d898765f5f70994b15bde179b4e9bc54.avif?t=1732503360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sanguine the Reanimator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A master of alchemy and necromancy. She is unscrupulous for her goals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/d927567ad7649d72dbcfb486a66b96dd.avif?t=1732503360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bambooblade the Eastern Warrior</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist of MaouCat Studio's Dice and the Tower of the Reanimator: Glorious Princess. He comes from the Silver Kingdom in the Southeast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Guidelines for Streams and Let's Plays</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are happy to have you stream our games or upload Let's Plays of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may also monetize that gameplay, but only by using the features on online video platforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We would appreciate it if you would include the game name in the stream or Let's Play title, or put the Steam page link in the description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We take no responsibility for any damage caused by your streams or Let's Plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark fantasy classic RPG. Customize your race, gender and class. Gather a party with your favorite companions. Change the fate of the characters and the world with your choices. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create a character.</strong> Customize your race, sex, name, class and non-combat skill. Create a unique protagonist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who do you want to venture with?</strong> A human cleric, a dark elf ranger, or an orc defender? Gather a party that's the best for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices affect the plot.</strong> How you interact with people in neighboring country depends on you, but beware - you may start a war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-based combat with a focus on teamwork.</strong> Beware classes have their own strengths and weaknesses. Complement each other to win. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Characters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/f396a7976f32ef29c859019dc6d5d71a.avif?t=1732503360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Lord</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dark-one monarch who has lived for five hundred years. She is determined to end the perennial struggle between dark ones and humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/66b30e2486ab4181d6ac20ea35b6d419.avif?t=1732503360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hero</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A descendant of the legendary hero. It is a calling for him to expel dark ones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294380/extras/0007850c